OL,3,GNEWSA'No decision' yet on proposed
OL,4,Awastewater tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minister has said "no decision" has
OL,7,Fyet been made about the introduction of
OL,8,Fa new liquid waste charge - despite its
OL,9,Finclusion in the government's proposed
OL,10,F2027-2030 budget.
OL,12,FA new tax has been under consideration
OL,13,Ffor a number of years, to pay for the
OL,14,Freplacement of ageing pipes and work to
OL,15,Fenable pumping stations to deal with
OL,16,Fincreased volumes of water.
OL,18,FDetails of the proposed charge -
OL,19,Fincluding how much it will be or how
OL,20,Fpeople will pay it - have still not
OL,21,Fbeen made public.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
