OL,3,GNEWSA'No decision' yet on proposed
OL,4,Awastewater tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government's latest financial plan
OL,7,Fconfirmed ministers intend to raise "a
OL,8,Fminimum" of #10m per year from 2028
OL,9,Fthrough the introduction of new "user
OL,10,Fpays" charges for liquid waste.
